{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關稅收罪案調查科私煙電購專責小組今日（13日）派員「放蛇」買私煙，拘捕一名38歲男子，涉嫌負責派送私煙。</p><p>行動中，海關檢獲約4.8萬支懷疑私煙，估計市值約22萬港元，應課稅值約16萬港元，並扣查涉案私家車。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.600952+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:31:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_hash":"6c01cc9da8358e8db1039ec8987ee9b62880e37f5f4fd08e3ae4ec1114be5988","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}